            <ArticleTitle>A case of respiratory depression in a child with ultrarapid CYP2D6 metabolism after tramadol.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>e753-5</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <ELocationID EIdType="doi" ValidYN="Y">10.1542/peds.2014-2673</ELocationID>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>We discuss a case of severe respiratory depression in a child, with ultrarapid CYP2D6 genotype and obstructive sleep apnea syndrome, after taking tramadol for pain relief related to a day-case tonsillectomy.</AbstractText>
                <CopyrightInformation>Copyright © 2015 by the American Academy of Pediatrics.</CopyrightInformation>
            </Abstract>
